<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', padding: '60px', background: '#FFFFFF', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei, Arial' }}><Box style={{ height: 76, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 4, justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#2563EB', fontWeight: 'bold', letterSpacing: 1 }}>{ "读之前 · 先建立地图   /   3 / 3" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.2 }}>{ "分层与两条线程" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 1, background: '#E5E7EB', marginTop: 6, marginBottom: 12 }} /><Box style={{ height: 450, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24 }}><Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 12, padding: 8 }}><Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 6, padding: '0 16px' }}><Text style={{ width: 150, fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>{ "纯判据层" }</Text><Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 17, color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "Rules / Editing / Parser / Scope" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18, background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 6, padding: '0 16px' }}><Text style={{ width: 150, fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>{ "引擎层" }</Text><Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 17, color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "Engine（攒池子、匹配、排序）" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 6, padding: '0 16px' }}><Text style={{ width: 150, fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>{ "宿主层" }</Text><Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 17, color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "VbeBackend（唯一大面积碰 COM）" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18, background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 6, padding: '0 16px' }}><Text style={{ width: 150, fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>{ "主流程层" }</Text><Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 17, color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "App（钩子 + 轮询 + 按键路由）" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 18, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 6, padding: '0 16px' }}><Text style={{ width: 150, fontSize: 19, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>{ "界面层" }</Text><Text style={{ flex: 1, fontSize: 17, color: '#1E293B' }}>{ "PopupForm / SettingsForm / SnippetForm" }</Text></Box></Box><Box style={{ width: 330, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 16 }}><Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#1E3A8A', borderRadius: 8, padding: 18, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#FFFFFF' }}>{ "钩子线程" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#DBEAFE', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>{ "快；只读内存状态。绝不碰 COM、绝不 Sleep——它卡一下，用户整个键盘就卡住。" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 8, padding: 18, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10 }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1E3A8A' }}>{ "UI 线程" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#1E293B', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>{ "慢；能读真 VBE 代码、能画窗口。两条线程靠一份内存快照接力。" }</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{ height: 40, background: '#1E3A8A', borderRadius: 8, padding: '0 16px', flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#FFFFFF', fontWeight: 'bold' }}>{ "本页结论：纯判据（Rules/Editing/Parser/Scope）→ 引擎（Engine）→ 宿主（VbeBacke…" }</Text></Box><Box style={{ position: 'absolute', bottom: 30, left: 60, right: 60, height: 20, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>{ "VbeComplete-CS · 逐文件精读 · 面向零基础读者" }</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B' }}>{ "P07 / 87" }</Text></Box></Slide>